Installed-Size: __INSTALLED_SIZE__
Description: Context-aware radial action wheel for X11 desktops
 Radivine ("Branch into action.") is a fast, extensible, context-aware
 hierarchical radial action wheel for Linux Mint Cinnamon and Ubuntu-based
 X11 desktops.
 .
 Press Shift while dragging files from Nemo (or invoke via CLI, keyboard
 shortcut, or the Nemo "Open in Radivine" context menu action) to summon a
 branching radial wheel directly under the cursor. Includes a dedicated
 read-only file preview application (radivine-viewer) supporting Full,
 Head, and Tail modes, multi-target X11 clipboard integration, native file
 manager properties via D-Bus, and user-defined shell-free custom actions.
